<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110335" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαρμᾰκ-ίτης</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drugged</i> or <i>medicated,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δακτύλιος φ.</span> a ring <i>containing
				poison,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				87
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος φ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Semus
					5a
				</span></i>
			; fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαρμακῖτις γῆ,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπελῖτις</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.160
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φ. σαύρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aët.
					13.56
				</span></i>
			; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ φ.</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βίβλος</span>) <i>On Drugs,</i> title of lost
			work by Hippocrates, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aff.</u>
				9.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				28
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαρμακίτιδες βίβλοι,</span>
			by Andromachus, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.891
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀδηφάγος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαγεσωρῖτις.</span></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
